{"repositoryId":1364546882,"availability":"available","full":"jcdavis131/gods-eye-view","name":"gods-eye-view","description":"Embedding Atlas — a living map of the world's occupations and markets, with live weather and sports layers. Live at eye.jcamd.com.","category":"Other","language":"TypeScript","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-10T16:29:27Z","updated":"2026-10-16T02:29:41Z","license":"MIT","branch":"master","homepage":"https://gods-eye-view-rust.vercel.app","topics":["embedding-atlas","geospatial","live-data","nextjs","occupations","open-data"],"demo":"https://gods-eye-view-rust.vercel.app/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:42.187Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:42.187Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-16T02:48:42.187Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-16T02:48:42.187Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Next.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A spy satellite simulator in your browser, except the data is real.","A photorealistic 3D globe that fuses live public signals: every aircraft broadcasting ADS-B, ships on AIS, satellites propagated from CelesTrak elements, earthquakes as USGS reports them, open-data public cameras, upcoming rocket launches. And the thing the others don't do: the water that keeps communities alive. Rivers, lakes and reservoirs with their live gauges, the aquifers under them, this week's drought, and turbidity computed in your browser from the latest Sentinel-2 pass, with a community water report that shows its arithmetic. And, from the same public sources, the economy in…","Live: (also deploys from master). One hosting caveat: OpenSky refuses Vercel's egress, so the zoomed-out aircraft view there falls back to adsb.lol around the view centre plus the military feed; run it locally or add OpenSky credentials for the full global picture."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jcdavis131/gods-eye-view/blob/master/README.md","fingerprint":"02dd8b9c1d0cf48329def5f4a4c1ab66810